  {
   "id": "rLEuZahPBwAJ",
   "from": "Aaron Lin",
   "author": "2b817d827a97bc21",
   "date": "2017-05-01T08:06:30Z",
   "subject": "用R做文字探勘，使用tm+jiebaR，出現 invalid multibyte string問題",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(29,33,41);font-size:15px\">各位高手好，小弟要用R做文字探勘，使用tm+jiebaR，在把Corpus轉成dtm後，執行inspect(dtm)，出現下面的錯誤訊息，看起來好像是編碼的問題，查了網路上的文章，還是沒辦法解決，請該如何解決? 先謝謝各位。</p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(29,33,41);font-size:15px\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(29,33,41);font-size:15px\">&lt;&lt;DocumentTermMatrix (documents: 3, terms: 49)&gt;&gt;<br>Non-/sparse entries: 51/96<br>Sparsity : 65%<span style=\"display:inline;font-family:inherit\"><br>Error in nchar(Terms(x), type = &quot;chars&quot;) : <br>invalid multibyte string, element 29</span></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(29,33,41);font-size:15px\"><span style=\"display:inline;font-family:inherit\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(29,33,41);font-size:15px\"><span style=\"display:inline;font-family:inherit\">語系資料：</span></p><div style=\"display:inline\"><p style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:inherit;font-size:15px\">&gt; Sys.getlocale()<br>[1] &quot;LC_COLLATE=Chinese (Traditional)_Taiwan.950;LC_CTYPE=Chinese (Traditional)_Taiwan.950;LC_MONETARY=Chinese (Traditional)_Taiwan.950;LC_NUMERIC=C;LC_TIME=Chinese (Traditional)_Taiwan.950&quot;</p><p style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:inherit;font-size:15px\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:inherit;font-size:15px\">程式碼：</p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">library(&quot;NLP&quot;)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">library(&quot;tm&quot;)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">library(&quot;jiebaRD&quot;)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">library(&quot;jiebaR&quot;)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">jieba_tokenizer=function(d){</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">  unlist(segment(d[[1]],seg))</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">}</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">seg=worker(write=&#39;NOFILE&#39;)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">src &lt;- &quot;這是測試文字。&quot;</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">doc=VCorpus(VectorSource(src))</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">doc=tm_map(doc,stripWhitespace)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">doc=tm_map(doc,removeNumbers)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">control.list=list(wordLengths=c(1,Inf),tokenize=jieba_tokenizer)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">dtm=DocumentTermMatrix(Corpus(VectorSource(doc)),control=control.list)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">inspect(dtm)</span></font></p><div style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><br></div><p style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:6px\"><br></p></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "E1ZPkEtdBwAJ",
   "from": "WEPA ^_^",
