   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, Aaron<div><br></div><div>I encountered the same problem. I tried to use the tm package in R to do some analysis with traditional Chinese content, and got the same error message. </div><div>Would you please share with me the modified tm package you got from others? Thank you so much in advance!</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards</div><div>Pinko</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><div><br>On Monday, May 1, 2017 at 8:32:11 PM UTC+8, Aaron Lin wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">WEPA您好：<div><br></div><div>加了地區資料還是一樣的Error。</div><div><br></div><div>好像是原tm包的問題，對中文的處理有一些問題，剛剛詢問高手，</div><div>後來是download別人修改好的tm包回來自己安裝，就可以了。</div><div>謝謝您的幫忙!</div><div><br><br>WEPA ^_^於 2017年5月1日星期一 UTC+8下午8時16分25秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Aaron,<div><br></div><div>測試 Windows 10 + R-3.4.0 +  RStudio-1.0.143 結果皆是正常, 加入以下設定, 看看是否有用?</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Sys</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">setlocale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;LC_TIME&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;C&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># 地區設定</span></div></code></div><br><br></div><div>Aaron Lin於 2017年5月1日星期一 UTC+8下午4時06分30秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(29,33,41);font-size:15px\">各位高手好，小弟要用R做文字探勘，使用tm+jiebaR，在把Corpus轉成dtm後，執行inspect(dtm)，出現下面的錯誤訊息，看起來好像是編碼的問題，查了網路上的文章，還是沒辦法解決，請該如何解決? 先謝謝各位。</p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(29,33,41);font-size:15px\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(29,33,41);font-size:15px\">&lt;&lt;DocumentTermMatrix (documents: 3, terms: 49)&gt;&gt;<br>Non-/sparse entries: 51/96<br>Sparsity : 65%<span style=\"display:inline;font-family:inherit\"><br>Error in nchar(Terms(x), type = &quot;chars&quot;) : <br>invalid multibyte string, element 29</span></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(29,33,41);font-size:15px\"><span style=\"display:inline;font-family:inherit\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(29,33,41);font-size:15px\"><span style=\"display:inline;font-family:inherit\">語系資料：</span></p><div style=\"display:inline\"><p style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:inherit;font-size:15px\">&gt; Sys.getlocale()<br>[1] &quot;LC_COLLATE=Chinese (Traditional)_Taiwan.950;LC_CTYPE=Chinese (Traditional)_Taiwan.950;LC_MONETARY=Chinese (Traditional)_Taiwan.950;LC_NUMERIC=C;LC_TIME=Chinese (Traditional)_Taiwan.950&quot;</p><p style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:inherit;font-size:15px\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:inherit;font-size:15px\">程式碼：</p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">library(&quot;NLP&quot;)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">library(&quot;tm&quot;)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">library(&quot;jiebaRD&quot;)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">library(&quot;jiebaR&quot;)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">jieba_tokenizer=function(d){</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">  unlist(segment(d[[1]],seg))</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">}</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">seg=worker(write=&#39;NOFILE&#39;)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">src &lt;- &quot;這是測試文字。&quot;</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">doc=VCorpus(VectorSource(src))</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">doc=tm_map(doc,stripWhitespace)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">doc=tm_map(doc,removeNumbers)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">control.list=list(wordLengths=c(1,Inf),tokenize=jieba_tokenizer)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">dtm=DocumentTermMatrix(Corpus(VectorSource(doc)),control=control.list)</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#1d2129\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">inspect(dtm)</span></font></p><div style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><br></div><p style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:6px\"><br></p></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
