    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, Aaron<div><br></div><div>I encountered the same problem. I tried to use the tm package in R to do some analysis with traditional Chinese content, and got the same error message. </div><div>Would you please share with me the modified tm package you got from others? Thank you so much in advance!</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards</div><div>Pinko<br><div><br>On Monday, May 1, 2017 at 8:32:11 PM UTC+8, Aaron Lin wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">WEPA您好：<div><br></div><div>加了地區資料還是一樣的Error。</div><div><br></div><div>好像是原tm包的問題，對中文的處理有一些問題，剛剛詢問高手，</div><div>後來是download別人修改好的tm包回來自己安裝，就可以了。</div><div>謝謝您的幫忙!</div><div><br><br>WEPA ^_^於 2017年5月1日星期一 UTC+8下午8時16分25秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Aaron,<div><br></div><div>測試 Windows 10 + R-3.4.0 +  RStudio-1.0.143 結果皆是正常, 加入以下設定, 看看是否有用?</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Sys</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">setlocale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;LC_TIME&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;C&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># 地區設定</span></div></code></div><br><br></div><div>Aaron Lin於 2017年5月1日星期一 UTC+8下午4時06分30秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-fami